# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .gitignore
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Git exclusion rules (repository hygiene)
# * Function     : Keeps locally generated build output, editor state,
# *                runtime scratch and local secrets out of version
# *                control, while leaving every migration deliverable -
# *                and the whole frozen legacy corpus under app/ -
# *                fully visible. No ignore, formatter or linter
# *                configuration previously existed anywhere in this
# *                repository, so this convention is ESTABLISHED rather
# *                than inherited.
# * Derived from : CONTRIBUTING.md:33-34 (focus on the specific change;
# *                ensure local tests pass) and README.md:209-275,
# *                whose Application Inventory and Application Screens
# *                tables document the legacy transaction, program and
# *                JCL corpus as deliberate, permanently tracked
# *                content.
